msgstr "एक्सप्रेस चेकआउट"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:80
msgid ""
"You can enable a :guilabel:`Buy Now` button on products' pages which "
"instantly takes the customer to the :guilabel:`Confirm Order` checkout page, "
"instead of adding the product to the cart. To do so, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings --> Shop - "
"Checkout Process section` and tick :guilabel:`Buy Now`. Alternatively, "
"the :guilabel:`Buy Now` button can also be enabled from any product's page "
"by going :menuselection:`Edit --> Customize`, in the :guilabel:`Cart` "
"section."
