#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/pages.rst:61
msgid "Homepage"
msgstr "होमपेज"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/pages.rst:63
msgid ""
"When you create a website, Odoo creates a dedicated :guilabel:`Home` page by "
